{"title":"Lizper Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 56) · Monster drop: Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Old Mother Ashka, Kragg The Unmoved, Gutrot The Carver, Ogre Charger +5 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 56 <span class=\"muted\">(8719 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\">Lizper Scale</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimewing\" title=\"Rimewing - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8c3a3c351144b327cb83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimewing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 8 of 129 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 7 of 129 looted corpses (1/18)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/18<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 6 of 128 looted corpses (1/21)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/21<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 6 of 129 looted corpses (1/22)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/22<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-youth\" title=\"Ogre Youth - dropped it in 1 of 142 looted corpses (1/142)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/8fe05349771531a800b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/142<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 516 looted corpses (1/516)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/516<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 1,011 looted corpses (1/1,011)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,011<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 2 of 2,106 looted corpses (1/1,053)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,053<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" da